{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30170","headline":"题吕食新水阁兼寄南商州郎中 · 朱景玄","name":"题吕食新水阁兼寄南商州郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丹槛初结构，孤高冠清川。\n庭临谷中树，檐落山上泉。\n晓色挂残月，夜声杂繁弦。\n青春去如水，康乐归何年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱景玄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30170.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30170","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}